### 7. Budget and Measurement

The proposed media budget is ₹14,000 for 14 days, equivalent to an average planned daily budget of ₹1,000.

The proposed budget is intended for planning purposes only. No media expenditure has occurred.

If implemented, campaign performance would be evaluated using reach, impressions, engagement rate, click-through rate, link clicks, and product-page visits. A/B testing would help compare creative messages, provided sufficient data is available.

