### 9. Project Status and Disclosure

This is an independent portfolio project and a proposed campaign plan.

Campaign planning and documentation have been completed for portfolio purposes, but the campaign has not been launched.

No advertisements have been published, no media budget has been spent, and no real campaign performance results are claimed.

The proposed audience, budget allocation, content, and campaign objectives would require validation before real-world implementation.
